<Slide notes={`观察窗口是算得出来的。

这一轮从二零二六年十月十七日九点五十分开始，带东八区时区，步长一分钟，请求四十八步。调度器的第一个 Step 用起始时间，后面逐步推进，所以第 k 步的虚拟时间等于起始时间加上 k 减一倍的步长。

代入以后，第一步是九点五十，第十一步是十点，第四十一步是十点半，第四十八步是十点三十七。

这个窗口能看见手作被更正到十点半以后有没有人到达、有没有开始，却不能证明十一点半的活动已经完整结束。要观察活动结束，就得另外设计足够长的实验，不能把「已经开始」记成「已经完成」。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>3.9.3　先把观察窗口算清楚</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>48 步落在哪些时刻</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 12 }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>窗口覆盖到哪一步，就只证明到哪一步</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>第 k 步虚拟时间 = 起始时间 + (k − 1) × 步长　·　2026-10-17 09:50　+08:00　·　节点间距不按比例</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 240, height: 104, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>Step 1</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#276FBF' }}>09:50</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>配置起点</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 104, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 240, height: 104, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>Step 11</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#276FBF' }}>10:00</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>原消息开始</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 104, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 240, height: 104, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>Step 41</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#276FBF' }}>10:30</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>更正后开始</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 104, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#26816B' }}>›</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 240, height: 104, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>Step 48</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#26816B' }}>10:37</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>观察窗口终点</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 16, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'row' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 1000, height: 16, background: '#276FBF', borderRadius: 8 }} />
                <Box style={{ width: 152, height: 16, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 8 }} />
            </Box>
