            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', flex: 1 }}>在观察窗口之外，虚线伸出窗口；本次观察没有依据去说它已经完整结束</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 566, height: 62, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 18px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>窗口内可观察</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>获知 · 移动 · 到达 · 开始</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 566, height: 62, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 18px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#546779' }}>窗口不能证明</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>11:30 的活动已完整结束</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>3.9 启动、观察与估算：读懂一次仿真的进度</Text>
